rlwind  tour of how to get the most convenient  full-text  access and site things in your work i  want to leave you with  this connect connect to us slide contact  us connect to us and  all of it's good and then for those of  you who may visit us in portland  i want to offer this final slide if you  do visit portland we really look forward  to meeting you in person  in the bc building the library is on the  second  and third and fourth floors um  dmice is on the fourth and fifth floors  we have a 24  7 space in the book for all members we  have networked computers  special workstations you can check out  emerging technologies  meet in technology equipped spaces and  even do mundane things like  printing and scanning so thank you very  much for your patience and attention to  this video  i hope that you've learned something  that will help you succeed in your work  in d mice  and i look forward to meeting you in the  future thank you
 

